2026-07-27T09:20:16.2340371Z i /tmp/RtmpHIGYCW/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:20:16.2340739Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:20:16.2341166Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:20:16.2341580Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:20:16.2342159Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:20:16.2343344Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:20:16.2344355Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
